# Canonical author identity.
#
# Collapses every address and display name this repository has been
# committed under into one person, so `git log`, `git shortlog -sne` and
# anything else that reads .mailmap show a single contributor.
#
# NOTE: GitHub's web UI attributes commits by the RAW commit email, not
# by this file. Commits authored with ruhela.vansh@gmail.com (23 of them
# in rmorie, 2026-08-15/16) will keep rendering under an older account
# until that address is added to the rootcoder007 account at
# https://github.com/settings/emails, which re-attributes them
# retroactively with no history rewrite.
